Z||000010||william_thorniii||12-14-2000||10:26 AM||||GTB,<P>I enjoy BT with Sarah McLaughlin "Dreaming"  It is just over nine minutes start to finish of electronic and Sarah listening pleasure.  I find it to be an interesting mix.  <P>Another would be William Orbits version of Samuel Barber's Adagio in Strings from his 2000 release titled "Pieces in a modern style".  <P>Once again you and I are on the same track.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||14
