Z||000017||batboy||12-22-2000||10:06 PM||||There is a brand new Sammy Hagar tune out called "Let Sally Drive" and does it ever rock! The speed queen lady in the song feels sooo sexy behind the wheel, has a 427, full blown nitrous with 4.11's and does 10.13 in the quarter mile, tells the guys to "catch me if you can". Of course the other Sammy Hagar cruising classic is "I can't drive 55."<P>Dale, I can't believe I've never gotten a speeding ticket when driving and listening to "Highway Star" or "Raydar Love" ahhhhh, those were great tunes.||||reg||6
Z||000018||DaRkLoRD||12-22-2000||10:30 PM||||I was on the Freenet development list for over a year, but it was full of a bunch of idiots who just flamed each other.. every so often a worthwhile email came through that was actually talking about the project, but the code got too complicated for me to understand and in the middle of one of the larger heated discussions, I left.. I hear that since then Freenet has become somewhat operational..<P>I'm still looking for another alternative though. Scour is gone, Napster isn't perfect.. what's left??<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
